<h4>Emerald RNG Guide</h4>
<p>All recommended Pokémon for completing 100% Emerald are stationnary Pokémon.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.pokemonrng.com/emerald-static/">Emerald Stationnary Guide</a> (Go directly to step 3: Catch and Calibrate)</p>

<h3>Latios</h3>
<p><span style="font-weight:bold">Target advance:</span>4571</p>

<p>Nature: Modest, IV: HP:29, Atk:21, Def:15, SpA:31, SpD:23, Spe:29.</p>
<p>Requires Eon Ticket (to access Southern Island)</p>
<p>After defeating the Elite Four, picking Red as the color on the TV so Latias is roaming Hoenn (and Latios is in Southern Island)</p>

